      <title>戚薇主动授权AI数字分身：与其被拿走不如自己出击</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260903/%E6%88%9A%E8%96%87%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83AI%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E5%88%86%E8%BA%AB%E4%B8%8E%E5%85%B6%E8%A2%AB%E6%8B%BF%E8%B5%B0%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%82%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E5%87%BA%E5%87%BB/</link>
